<title>BENIN: SOCCER-BENIN AND IVORY COAST DRAW 0-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BENIN AND IVORY COAST DRAW 0-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>COTONOU 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benin and Ivory Coast drew 0-0 in their group two African Nations Cup qualifier in Cotonou on Sunday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000</p>
</text>
